ut I think you'll likely need to use TextSpan to get the keyboard focus highlights."]],0,1431],[7168086,20413,260,6.141,4.678,[[0,1.0,984,262]],[["59a600e0_daee2921",12,-2,0,"Thanks for this!"],["7968a87e_ec61172b",12,-2,0,"optional not: use a variable for the 0"],["ab701639_ad673d1a",12,-2,0,"Is this only true for the icon?"]],0,1432],[7202532,20417,4,0.07,0.046,[[15,18]],[],0,1433],[7199186,20417,127,2.361,1.866,[[16,0.508,0,65],[0,0.492,985,62]],[["3dcbe163_8535bac0",33,-1,0,"This is a very useful comment, thanks for adding it!"],["be7c05a5_69068f21",34,-1,1,"Please fix this WARNING reported by Spellchecker: \"entriess\" is a possible misspelling of \"entries\". To bypass Spellchecker, add ... \"entriess\" is a possible misspelling of \"entries\". To bypass…"]],0,1434],[7202827,20417,45,1.144,0.818,[[0,986]],[],0,1435],[7198284,20418,98,2.113,1.57,[[0,987]],[["a8090eae_2ca11467",12,-1,0,"Does this work? We're creating the emptyFragment here."]],0,1436],[7180880,20420,209,4.14,3.17,[[0,0.982,988,207],[10,0.009,202,1],[14,0.009,21,1]],[["2c38cb56_ecccd2fc",28,-7,1,"I think we should call onCreateView always, specifically for the cases to restore it on activity recreate cases."],["56f2333b_4bd7a757",35,-7,1,"the name is not reflecting what it is? Maybe settings_detailed_title_height?"],["6277d371_c1396e20",36,-7,1,"instead, can we create the instance when the container gets ready? This class's responsibility is to update the views in the layout, by observing several events. It does not make sense to create this…"],["81684a9e_e1d6b734",36,-7,1,"I may not get this part. Do you mean \"Search results\" will be put in the fragment back stack? More document is appreciated."],["cb589850_f1c7c4ee",28,-7,1,"for simplicity, can we just use settings_preference_detail_pane.xml always? Then, you can control visibility of detailed title part."],["fd4ac036_8e9ac081",35,-7,1,"should be a vertical linear layout...?"],["076835d0_2dd03875",28,-3,1,"nit: The result of super method is d